<!-- RadarAtlasWindow — the ANVIL ATLAS: everything you can point the radar at. A PLACE (a radar site — this
     file's Radar sites tab) or a MOMENT (a saved past event — Composites/PastEventsAtlasTab). Floats over the
     map (map stays live), opened by the "Atlas" key on the bar (left of the Settings cog). Bound to the
     coordinator MapViewModel (like SettingsWindow): ViewModel.RadarAtlas.* for sites, ViewModel.SavedEvents.*
     for events, ViewModel.AtlasTabIndex for the tab (PERSISTED), ViewModel.IsRadarAtlasOpen for itself.
     ⚠️ THE LINE THAT KEEPS IT AN ATLAS: things you can LOAD. Anything that CONFIGURES the radar (ramps, tilts,
     rings) belongs in Settings or the notches, never a third tab here. Agreed design: docs/anvil-atlas.md.

