                                               Aug 28      each cell is one day · dot = NWS message      Today
                                               Sep 25, 8:09 PM   ● Down 13 hr 27 min, ongoing        ✉ ← msg = tooltip
                                               Sep 14, 3:10 AM   ● Gap 55 min                          (newest 6)
