                                               YOUR USE  since Mar 4, 2026  [⌫ Clear]   ← Clear → ClearSiteUsageDialog
                                               ┌ 27       ┐ ┌ 6.4 hr  ⑦┐ ┌ Now      ┐ ┌ #1          ┐
                                               │ LOADS ·  │ │ SITE LOAD│ │ LAST USED│ │ OF 14 SITES │ ← never used: ONE line
                                               │ 22 NOW-  │ │ TIME ·   │ │          │ │ YOU USE     │   "You haven't loaded X yet."
                                               └ CAST, 5… ┘ └ 5.2 HR N…┘ └──────────┘ └─────────────┘   (both splits: NowCast, PastCast)

     THE FILTER BLOCK IS TWO ROWS AND THE SPLIT IS THE WHOLE POINT: row 1 is where you CHANGE the
     filtering, row 2 is what filtering is currently IN EFFECT. Don't move a control between them.
     ⚠️ It sits in the 360 column, not across the window — which is the constraint that shapes it. Row 1
     is already ~334 of the 360, so a FOURTH control does not go there; anything new belongs in the flyout.
     ⚠️ ROW 2 IS PERMANENT (reserved height) so the list doesn't jump as the first chip appears. It is
     never empty: the count reads "204 sites" at rest and "118 of 204" once anything narrows the list.

     CHIPS (Primitives-free: an ItemsControl over RadarAtlas.Chips on a Layout/WrapPanel) are removable
     ACTIVE-FILTER feedback, and the fast way to undo ONE filter without reopening the flyout.
     ⚠️ ONE CHIP PER GROUP, not per ticked box — three networks read "NEXRAD +2" — so the row can't grow
     past five chips however much is ticked. The ✕ clears the whole group.
     ⚠️ ONLY flyout-hidden filters get a chip. Favorites and the search box are VISIBLE and already show
     their own state; a chip for either would be the same fact twice. Sort is the exception in the other
     direction: not a filter, but it gets a chip when it isn't the default, and "Clear all" leaves it alone.
     The words for all of it live in the VM (chip labels, the count, the status labels that change in
     PastCast) — never assemble a label out of XAML strings.

     THE FLYOUT holds network (multi-tick), status (three independent ticks, NOT one "online only"),
     region + state, then a rule and the sort. ⚠️ Region and state come from RadarSite.State, which
     tools/make_site_states.py stamps into the bundled site files from the basemap's own state layer —
     regenerate, never hand-edit. ⚠️ The TDWR/Research ticks grey out with Settings → Radar, and
     "narrowed" is measured against what's SELECTABLE (see EnabledNetworks) or a hidden network leaves a
     chip that can't be cleared. Sort's "Nearest" greys out without a location marker.

     ⑦ = GlossaryHint, the "?" that explains one readout (Primitives/GlossaryHint + Core's RadarGlossary).
     ⚠️ HOVER TARGET IS THE "?" ONLY, never the tile — someone who knows what a VCP is shouldn't trip a
     popover just crossing the pane. The words live in Core, NEVER in this XAML.
     ⚠️ A TILE'S VALUE = GLANCEABLE (an age, the VCP alone), ITS LABEL = PRECISE (the clock time, the regime) —
     the old site card's job, folded into the tiles. Both read the same properties, so they can't disagree;
     the age tile's green→amber→red knees are the glossary's own.

     SECTIONS (Home / Favorites · n / All sites · n) come from a grouped CollectionViewSource over
     RadarAtlas.SiteGroups. ⚠️ Its Source is set in code when ViewModel lands (OnViewModelChanged) — a CVS
     can't x:Bind — and it must land BEFORE the SelectedItem binding runs, which the DP callback order gives.
     A row sits in ONE section. The row's ☆/★ toggles favorite without selecting the row; [★] and [⌂] in the
     header act on the selected site (RadarSiteFavoritesViewModel). Home is one site: setting it moves it.

     ROWS ARE KEYS, in the map key's vocabulary without copying it: a card per row (transparent centre at rest,
     lifted on hover), the STATUS block a tall bar
     (width == half the row height) on the left, the NETWORK bar just left of the star (neutral ◗ NEXRAD / blue ✈ TDWR / violet ⚗ research,
     the key's own glyphs as paths). Selected = elevated face + thin accent stroke — quiet on purpose; the map
     key's bright inverted face stays on the MAP only.

     ⚠️ NETWORK ≠ STATUS. The row's right-hand bar (NEXRAD / TDWR / Research, named in its tooltip) and the
     network filter are the radar's NETWORK; the square + STATUS pill are whether data is flowing (green Online · red Offline · grey
     "Checking…" before the first pass). The network read "Operational" once, which looked like a status
     beside a red dot. In PastCast the status is the REPLAY DAY's ("Data on replay day") and the checkbox
     relabels to match. Status comes from RadarSiteRow.Availability, bound DIRECTLY (not through a VM
     snapshot), so a pass that lands while a site is selected updates the pill and dot in place.

     The header owns the action: the button reads "On map" (disabled) while the selected site IS the
     map's site. It is the SAME header grammar as a past event's (name · badges · actions), on purpose — the
     two tabs read as one Atlas. Chips are neutral pills; only the status dot carries colour. The DISTANCE
     tile collapses when there's no location marker, so it never leaves a hole.
     ⚠️ The list-row container style and the field label styles live in Styles.xaml (AtlasRowItemStyle,
     AtlasFieldLabelStyle / AtlasFieldValueStyle) because the Past events tab uses them too.

     The row's network label sits flush RIGHT only because the item container stretches its content
     (HorizontalContentAlignment=Stretch) — without it the row Grid shrinks and the label hugs the name.
     The photo panel is a dummy: nothing feeds it yet (no bundled per-site photos exist).

     The OS caption is the only chrome, and content extends into it — which is why the title BAND is drawn
     here, and why its right corner stays clear for the lock, pin and caption buttons.

     The list selection FOLLOWS the map's radar site (marker click → that row selected, scrolled into
     view, even while the window is closed), and "Load on map" greys out while the selected row IS the
     map's site. A search/filter that hides the loaded site keeps it in the detail pane.

     ⚠️ The detail's live scan info has TWO sources, and the split is deliberate: the site the LOOP is
     on reads its time straight off RadarViewModel (no fetch — re-fetching it would download the whole
     chunks listing and clobber the shared live cache), every other site asks
     ILevel2RadarService.GetLatestScanAsync. -->

<UserControl x:Class="Anvil.Controls.Windows.RadarAtlasWindow"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:ctl="using:Anvil.Controls.Primitives"
             xmlns:layout="using:Anvil.Layout"
             xmlns:conv="using:Anvil.Converters"
             xmlns:vm="using:Anvil.ViewModels"
             xmlns:win="using:Anvil.Controls.Windows"
             xmlns:comp="using:Anvil.Controls.Composites"
             xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
             xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
             mc:Ignorable="d">

    <UserControl.Resources>
        <conv:SiteAvailabilityToBrushConverter x:Key="AvailabilityToBrush"/>

        <!-- The list's sections. Source set in code-behind (see the header). -->
        <CollectionViewSource x:Key="SiteGroupsSource" IsSourceGrouped="True"/>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <!-- Root Grid -->
    <!-- Dark surface fills the whole window; content sits top-left. -->
    <Grid Background="{ThemeResource OverlayBarSurfaceBrush}">
            <Grid>

                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- the title band -->
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- the tabs -->
                    <RowDefinition Height="*"/>    <!-- body: the selected tab -->
                </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                <!-- THE TITLE BAND — full width, over the tabs. Content extends into the title bar (the native
                     caption shows only its buttons), so the band IS the window's title.
                     ⚠️ Its right 220 px are RESERVED: the lock + pin (Margin 178 / 140 from the right) and the
                     caption buttons sit over that corner, so the counts end before it.
                     ⚠️ The counts FOLLOW THE TAB (networks on Radar sites, types on Past events) and describe the
                     WHOLE Atlas, never the filtered list — the result count under the filters answers the search. -->
                <Grid Grid.Row="0" Padding="16,12,0,12" ColumnSpacing="14"
                      Background="{ThemeResource OverlayBarSurfaceRaisedBrush}">
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- logo slot -->
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>    <!-- name -->
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- counts -->
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="220"/>  <!-- lock / pin / caption corner -->
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                    <!-- LOGO SLOT — a placeholder until the app has a logo. -->
                    <Grid Width="40" Height="40" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Rectangle RadiusX="8" RadiusY="8" StrokeThickness="1" StrokeDashArray="3,3"
                                   Stroke="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                        <FontIcon Glyph="&#xE722;" FontSize="16"
                                  Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                    </Grid>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="Anvil Atlas" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                               FontSize="22" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>

                    <!-- Radar sites: per network, rule, total. -->
                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="20" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                Visibility="{x:Bind TabVisibility(ViewModel.AtlasTabIndex, 0), Mode=OneWay}">
                        <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Count(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NexradCount), Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="NEXRAD" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.Radar.ShowTdwrs), Mode=OneWay}">
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Count(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.TdwrCount), Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="TDWR" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.Radar.ShowResearchRadars), Mode=OneWay}">
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Count(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.ResearchCount), Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="RESEARCH" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <Border Width="1" Background="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}"/>
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Count(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.ShownSiteCount), Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="RADAR SITES" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <!-- Past events: per type, rule, total, custom. A custom event counts in its type too. -->
                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="20" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                Visibility="{x:Bind TabVisibility(ViewModel.AtlasTabIndex, 1), Mode=OneWay}">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Count(ViewModel.SavedEvents.TornadoCount), Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="TORNADO" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Count(ViewModel.SavedEvents.HurricaneCount), Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="HURRICANE" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Count(ViewModel.SavedEvents.DerechoCount), Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="DERECHO" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <Border Width="1" Background="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}"/>
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Count(ViewModel.SavedEvents.TotalCount), Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="PAST EVENTS" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Count(ViewModel.SavedEvents.CustomCount), Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="CUSTOM" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Grid>

                <!-- THE TABS (Primitives/TabStrip, top rail) + the hairline under them. The index is PERSISTED
                     (MapViewModel.AtlasTabIndex); the bodies below switch on it and stay loaded. -->
                <ctl:TabStrip Grid.Row="1" Margin="12,6,12,0"
                              HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                              ItemsSource="{x:Bind Tabs}"
                              SelectedIndex="{x:Bind ViewModel.AtlasTabIndex, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
                <Border Grid.Row="1" Height="1" VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                        Background="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}"/>

                <!-- PAST EVENTS — its own Composite (list | detail), the same frame as the sites body below. -->
                <comp:PastEventsAtlasTab Grid.Row="2" Margin="16,12,16,14"
                                         ViewModel="{x:Bind ViewModel}"
                                         Visibility="{x:Bind TabVisibility(ViewModel.AtlasTabIndex, 1), Mode=OneWay}"/>

                <!-- RADAR SITES body: list column (left) | detail (right). Side + bottom inset.
                     ⚠️ THE 32 IS THE SEPARATION. There is no rule and no outline between the two regions —
                     the gutter alone divides them, which is why it can't be trimmed back toward the 14 it
                     used to be. Space between regions must beat the space inside one (the list's own rows
                     sit 6 apart) or the eye can't tell where the list ends. -->
                <Grid Grid.Row="2"
                      Margin="16,12,16,14"
                      ColumnSpacing="32"
                      Visibility="{x:Bind TabVisibility(ViewModel.AtlasTabIndex, 0), Mode=OneWay}">

                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="360"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                    <!-- LEFT: the list column — search, controls, feedback, list. See the header for why
                         the last two are separate rows and why row 2 is permanent. -->
                    <Grid Grid.Column="0" RowSpacing="8">
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- search -->
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- ROW 1: the controls -->
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- ROW 2: the feedback -->
                            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>    <!-- the list -->
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                        <TextBox Grid.Row="0"
                                 PlaceholderText="Search ICAO or name…"
                                 Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SearchText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"/>

                        <!-- ROW 1 — THE CONTROLS. Three, and there is no room for a fourth. -->
                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                            <Button>
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <FontIcon FontSize="14" Glyph="&#xE71C;"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Filters"/>
                                    <FontIcon FontSize="10" Glyph="&#xE70D;"
                                              Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <Button.Flyout>
                                    <!-- Everything that isn't worth a permanent control. Grouped, in the
                                         order you'd narrow: which radars, are they up, where are they —
                                         then a rule, because SORT ISN'T A FILTER. -->
                                    <Flyout Placement="Bottom">
                                        <StackPanel Width="260" Spacing="4">
                                            <TextBlock Text="NETWORK" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            <CheckBox Content="NEXRAD"
                                                      IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.FilterNexrad, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
                                            <!-- Greyed while Settings → Radar hides the network (the list
                                                 has no sites from it either). -->
                                            <CheckBox Content="TDWR"
                                                      IsEnabled="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.IsTdwrFilterEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                      IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.FilterTdwr, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
                                            <CheckBox Content="Research"
                                                      IsEnabled="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.IsResearchFilterEnabled, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                      IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.FilterResearch, Mode=TwoWay}"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="STATUS" Margin="0,10,0,0"
                                                       Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            <CheckBox Content="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.StatusOnlineLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                      IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.StatusOnline, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
                                            <CheckBox Content="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.StatusOfflineLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                      IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.StatusOffline, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
                                            <CheckBox Content="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.StatusUncheckedLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                      IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.StatusUnchecked, Mode=TwoWay}"/>

                                            <TextBlock Text="PLACE" Margin="0,10,0,0"
                                                       Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            <!-- Independent on purpose: a contradictory pair (Alaska + FL)
                                                 empties the list and shows two clearable chips, which
                                                 explains itself better than silently re-pointing one. -->
                                            <ComboBox HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                                      ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.RegionOptions}"
                                                      SelectedItem="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedRegion, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
                                            <ComboBox HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Margin="0,4,0,0"
                                                      ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.StateOptions}"
                                                      SelectedItem="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedState, Mode=TwoWay}"/>

                                            <Border Margin="0,12,0,0" Height="1"
                                                    Background="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="SORT" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                                                       Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            <!-- Orders the ALL SITES section only — Home and Favorites keep
                                                 the order the user pinned them in. -->
                                            <RadioButtons SelectedIndex="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SortIndex, Mode=TwoWay}">
                                                <RadioButton Content="ICAO"/>
                                                <RadioButton Content="Name"/>
                                                <RadioButton Content="Nearest first"
                                                             IsEnabled="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.CanSortByDistance, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                             ToolTipService.ToolTip="Needs a location marker"/>
                                            </RadioButtons>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Flyout>
                                </Button.Flyout>
                            </Button>

                            <CheckBox Content="Favorites" VerticalAlignment="Center" MinWidth="0"
                                      ToolTipService.ToolTip="Show only the home site and favorites"
                                      IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.FavoritesOnly, Mode=TwoWay}"/>

                            <!-- Always present, greyed when there's nothing to clear: a button that came
                                 and went would shove the row around on every tick. -->
                            <Button Content="Clear all" Click="OnClearFiltersClick"
                                    IsEnabled="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.HasActiveFilters, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- ROW 2 — THE FEEDBACK. MinHeight reserves the line so the list below doesn't
                             jump when the first chip appears. -->
                        <Grid Grid.Row="2" MinHeight="24" ColumnSpacing="8">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                            <ItemsControl VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                          ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.Chips}">
                                <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                    <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                        <layout:WrapPanel HorizontalSpacing="6" VerticalSpacing="4"/>
                                    </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                    <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:AtlasFilterChip">
                                        <!-- A chip is the detail pane's neutral pill with a ✕ — same
                                             vocabulary, so the two regions read as one panel. -->
                                        <Border CornerRadius="11" Padding="9,2,4,2"
                                                Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="4">
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Label}" FontSize="12"
                                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                                <Button Padding="4,2" MinWidth="0" MinHeight="0"
                                                        Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0"
                                                        Click="OnChipClearClick"
                                                        ToolTipService.ToolTip="Clear this filter">
                                                    <FontIcon FontSize="10" Glyph="&#xE711;"
                                                              Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                </Button>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>
                                    </DataTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                            </ItemsControl>

                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.ResultCountText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                       FontSize="12"
                                       Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                        </Grid>

                        <!-- The filtered site list. NO outline — the gutter separates it from the detail,
                             and a box around rows that are already cards read as a frame inside a frame. -->
                        <Border Grid.Row="3"
                                BorderThickness="0" CornerRadius="8">
                            <ListView ItemsSource="{Binding Source={StaticResource SiteGroupsSource}}"
                                      SelectedItem="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                      SelectionMode="Single"
                                      Loaded="OnSiteListLoaded"
                                      SelectionChanged="OnSiteListSelectionChanged"
                                      ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource AtlasRowItemStyle}">
                                <ListView.GroupStyle>
                                    <GroupStyle>
                                        <GroupStyle.HeaderContainerStyle>
                                            <Style TargetType="ListViewHeaderItem">
                                                <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="0"/>
                                                <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,10,10,4"/>
                                            </Style>
                                        </GroupStyle.HeaderContainerStyle>
                                        <GroupStyle.HeaderTemplate>
                                            <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:RadarSiteGroup">
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Header}" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            </DataTemplate>
                                        </GroupStyle.HeaderTemplate>
                                    </GroupStyle>
                                </ListView.GroupStyle>
                                <ListView.ItemTemplate>
                                    <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:RadarSiteRow">
                                        <!-- The status column is HALF the row's MinHeight (25 of 50), so the colour block is a
                                             2:1 tall bar. Keep the ratio if you retune either. -->
                                        <Grid MinHeight="50">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="25"/>   <!-- status bar (½ MinHeight) -->
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>    <!-- ICAO + name -->
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="40"/>   <!-- network bar (22 px glyph) -->
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- favorite -->
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                            <!-- STATUS — the map key's left zone: a full-height half-width bar, the same literals. -->
                                            <Border Grid.Column="0" CornerRadius="5,0,0,5"
                                                    Background="{x:Bind Availability, Converter={StaticResource AvailabilityToBrush}, Mode=OneWay}"/>

                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="12,5" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Id}" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="15"/>
                                                    <FontIcon Glyph="&#xE80F;" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                              Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                                              Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ShowIf(IsHome), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                                <!-- "Norman · OK" — the state is what makes a 200-row list
                                                     findable; the name alone assumes you already know where
                                                     Melbourne is. -->
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind NameAndState}" FontSize="12"
                                                           TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                                           Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                            </StackPanel>

                                            <!-- Favorite star: toggles without selecting the row (the Button takes the click). -->
                                            <Button Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                    Padding="8,4" MinWidth="0" MinHeight="0"
                                                    Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0"
                                                    Click="OnRowFavoriteClick"
                                                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.FavoriteToolTip(IsFavorite), Mode=OneWay}">
                                                <FontIcon FontSize="14"
                                                          Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                                          Glyph="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.StarGlyph(IsFavorite), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                            </Button>

                                            <!-- NETWORK — left of the star: a themed neutral bar for NEXRAD, the data blue /
                                                 violet for TDWR / research, each with the key's own glyph (the SVG paths from
                                                 radar-sites.js CLASS_GLYPH, redrawn as XAML). Mid-row, so square corners and no
                                                 divider hairline. -->
                                            <Grid Grid.Column="2" ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind ClassLabel}">
                                                <Border Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                <Border Background="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.NetworkBrush(Site.Class)}"/>

                                                <Viewbox Width="22" Height="22"
                                                         Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ClassVisible(Site.Class, 'Operational')}">
                                                    <Canvas Width="24" Height="24">
                                                        <Ellipse Canvas.Left="5.6" Canvas.Top="15.6" Width="2.8" Height="2.8"
                                                                 Fill="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                        <Path Data="M7 12.5 A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 11.5 17"
                                                              Stroke="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" StrokeThickness="2"
                                                              StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round"/>
                                                        <Path Data="M7 7.5 A9.5 9.5 0 0 1 16.5 17"
                                                              Stroke="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}" StrokeThickness="2"
                                                              StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round"/>
                                                    </Canvas>
                                                </Viewbox>
                                                <Viewbox Width="22" Height="22"
                                                         Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ClassVisible(Site.Class, 'Tdwr')}">
                                                    <Canvas Width="24" Height="24">
                                                        <Path Fill="White"
                                                              Data="M12 2 C12.6 2 13 2.9 13 4 V9.2 L20 13.2 V15.1 L13 13.1 V17 L15 18.5 V20 L12 19 L9 20 V18.5 L11 17 V13.1 L4 15.1 V13.2 L11 9.2 V4 C11 2.9 11.4 2 12 2 Z"/>
                                                    </Canvas>
                                                </Viewbox>
                                                <Viewbox Width="22" Height="22"
                                                         Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ClassVisible(Site.Class, 'Research')}">
                                                    <Canvas Width="24" Height="24">
                                                        <Path Data="M9 3 H15" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2"
                                                              StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round"/>
                                                        <Path Data="M10 3 V8 L5.6 16.3 A1.9 1.9 0 0 0 7.3 19 H16.7 A1.9 1.9 0 0 0 18.4 16.3 L14 8 V3"
                                                              Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2" StrokeLineJoin="Round"
                                                              StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round"/>
                                                    </Canvas>
                                                </Viewbox>
                                            </Grid>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </DataTemplate>
                                </ListView.ItemTemplate>
                            </ListView>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- Right: detail pane for the selected site. Starts at the TOP of the body now — the
                         filter block moved into the list column, so there's no full-width row above to
                         clear, and the pane gets those 14 px of height back. -->
                    <Grid Grid.Column="1">
                        <!-- Empty hint when nothing is selected. -->
                        <TextBlock Text="Select a site to see its details."
                                   VerticalAlignment="Center" 
                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                   Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"
                                   Visibility="{x:Bind CollapsedWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.HasSelection), Mode=OneWay}"/>

                        <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                                      Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.HasSelection), Mode=OneWay}">
                        <!-- Width-capped + left-aligned: on a wide window the detail stays one compact block
                             instead of spreading its fields (and stranding the button) across the pane.
                             ⚠️ The cap is a star COLUMN's MaxWidth, not the Grid's MaxWidth+Left — a Left-aligned
                             Grid sizes to content, which collapses the * columns and un-pins the button. -->
                        <Grid RowSpacing="12"
                              VerticalAlignment="Top">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" MaxWidth="760"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- header: title | badges | actions -->
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- subtitle: kind · coordinates -->
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- tiles | photo -->
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- NWS status -->
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- data uptime -->
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- message history -->
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- scan patterns -->
                                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/> <!-- your use -->
                            </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                            <!-- HEADER — the SAME grammar as a past event's (Composites/PastEventsAtlasTab): the name,
                                 small badges, then the actions on the right. "On map" is this tab's Play. -->
                            <Grid Grid.Row="0" ColumnSpacing="8">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- status chip -->
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- network chip -->
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- favorite -->
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- home -->
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/> <!-- load -->
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Margin="0,0,16,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailTitle, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>

                                <!-- Status chip: neutral pill, the dot is the only colour. -->
                                <Border Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        CornerRadius="11" Padding="10,3"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                        <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                 Fill="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.StatusBrush(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.Availability), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.StatusLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   FontSize="12"/>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.StatusHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>

                                <Border Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        CornerRadius="11" Padding="10,3"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailClassLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   FontSize="12"
                                                   Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NetworkHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>

                                <Button Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                        Click="OnDetailFavoriteClick"
                                        ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.FavoriteToolTip(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.IsFavorite), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <FontIcon FontSize="16"
                                              Glyph="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.StarGlyph(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.IsFavorite), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                </Button>

                                <Button Grid.Column="4" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                        Click="OnDetailHomeClick"
                                        ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.HomeToolTip(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.IsHome), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                        <FontIcon FontSize="14" Glyph="&#xE80F;"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.HomeLabel(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.SelectedSite.IsHome), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Button>

                                <Button Grid.Column="5" VerticalAlignment="Center" MinWidth="120"
                                        Click="OnLoadClick"
                                        Style="{StaticResource AccentButtonStyle}"
                                        Content="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.LoadButtonText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                        IsEnabled="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.CanLoadOnMap, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                            </Grid>

                            <!-- SUBTITLE — the radar's kind + coordinates (they moved here from the old site card). -->
                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6" Margin="0,-6,0,0">
                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailSubtitle, Mode=OneWay}"
                                           FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                           Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                <ctl:GlossaryHint VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                  Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.CoordsHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- TILES — the old site card and the stat strip, collapsed into ONE row. The tile says the
                                 GLANCEABLE form big (an age, the VCP alone) and keeps the card's PRECISE form in its
                                 label (the clock time, the regime), so nothing the card said is lost. Each carries its
                                 own "?" hint.
                                 ⚠️ The age tile is the only one that carries colour, and its knees are the glossary's
                                 (green → amber at RecentKnee → red past Staleness), so the colour and the hint agree.
                                 ⚠️ The distance tile COLLAPSES with no location marker — an empty tile would read as
                                 missing data rather than as a feature you haven't used.
                                 The PHOTO slot is kept (a dummy — nothing feeds it yet), beside the tiles. -->
                            <Grid Grid.Row="2" ColumnSpacing="12">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="200"/>
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                <Border Grid.Column="0" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <!-- Spinner and value share ONE cell: the value is empty for exactly as
                                                 long as the fetch is in flight. -->
                                            <Grid>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailAgeValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                           FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                           Foreground="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.AgeBrush(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailAgeMinutes), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                                <ProgressRing Width="16" Height="16"
                                                              HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                              IsActive="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.IsLoadingScanInfo, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                              Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.IsLoadingScanInfo), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                            </Grid>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailScanClockLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.AgeHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>

                                <Border Grid.Column="1" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailScanValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ScanModeLabel(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailScanLabel), Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.ScanHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>

                                <Border Grid.Column="2" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                        Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhenText(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailDistanceValue), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DetailDistanceValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="FROM YOU" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <ctl:GlossaryHint HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                          Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.DistanceHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>

                                <!-- Site photo — DUMMY placeholder; nothing feeds it yet. 16:9. -->
                                <Border Grid.Column="3" Height="113" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                        CornerRadius="8"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource CardBackgroundFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                    <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Spacing="6">
                                        <FontIcon Glyph="&#xE722;" FontSize="24"
                                                  Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="Site photo" FontSize="12" HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                                   Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                            </Grid>
                            <!-- YOUR USE — how much YOU have used this site (SiteUsageTracker). Same tile vocabulary
                                 as the strip above, one more column. Header = caption · "since …" · Clear.
                                 ⚠️ Clear shows only with recorded history, and always CONFIRMS
                                 (Dialogs/ClearSiteUsageDialog) — it says how much goes before anything does.
                                 ⚠️ A never-used site swaps the four tiles for ONE line: a row of zeros and dashes
                                 would read as missing data. Only Site load time has a "?" (RadarGlossary.SiteLoadTime);
                                 the others say what they are. Every word comes from the VM.
                                 ⚠️ Loads and Site load time split the SAME way, by mode ("22 NOWCAST, 5 PASTCAST" /
                                 "5.2 HR NOWCAST, 1.2 HR PASTCAST", "ALL NOWCAST" when one side is empty) — keep
                                 the two labels alike. Both labels wrap. -->
                            <!-- NWS STATUS — the NWS's own account of this radar (RadarNwsStatusViewModel): what the RDA
                                 reports about itself, and the newest outage notice (FTM) a WFO issued for it. Header =
                                 caption · "checked 2 min ago" · Re-check (right). ⚠️ INFORMATION, NOT AVAILABILITY: the
                                 dot here is the RADAR's own report (green on-line / amber maintenance / red inoperable)
                                 and never moves the Online/Offline pill above — a quarter of healthy sites say
                                 "maintenance mandatory" on any day. ⚠️ Re-check covers EVERY site (two requests) and
                                 cools down 5 min from each attempt; the button counts it down ("Re-check in 3:04").
                                 The message text is NWS's verbatim (teletype caps, monospace); older ones fold under
                                 "n earlier messages". A site NWS doesn't list (research) swaps the card for ONE line.
                                 Every word comes from the VM (RadarNwsSiteDetail). -->
                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="3" Spacing="8" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                                <Grid ColumnSpacing="8">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <TextBlock Text="NWS STATUS" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1"
                                               Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsStatus.CheckedText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                    <!-- E72C Refresh. -->
                                    <Button Grid.Column="2" Padding="8,3" MinWidth="0" MinHeight="0"
                                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Click="OnNwsRecheckClick"
                                            IsEnabled="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsStatus.CanCheck, Mode=OneWay}"
                                            ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsStatus.CheckToolTip, Mode=OneWay}">
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                            <FontIcon FontSize="12" Glyph="&#xE72C;"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsStatus.CheckButtonText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="12"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Button>
                                </Grid>

                                <!-- Not checked / unreachable / not an NWS site: the one line. -->
                                <Border CornerRadius="8" Padding="14,12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                        Visibility="{x:Bind CollapsedWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.ShowTable), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.EmptyText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="13"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                </Border>

                                <!-- Same label | value rows as the site card; the message row is always last (no rule). -->
                                <Border CornerRadius="8" Padding="16,0" BorderThickness="1"
                                        BorderBrush="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource CardBackgroundFillColorDefaultBrush}"
                                        Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.ShowTable), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <StackPanel>
                                        <StackPanel Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.HasStation), Mode=OneWay}">
                                            <Border BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="0,8"
                                                    BorderBrush="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}">
                                                <Grid ColumnSpacing="16">
                                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="110"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="RADAR STATE" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                                    <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                                        <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                 Fill="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.NwsLevelBrush(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.Level), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.StateText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                                   Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldValueStyle}"/>
                                                    </StackPanel>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </Border>
                                            <Border BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="0,8"
                                                    BorderBrush="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}">
                                                <Grid ColumnSpacing="16">
                                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="110"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="ALARMS" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1"
                                                               Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.AlarmsText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldValueStyle}"/>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </Border>
                                            <Border BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="0,8"
                                                    BorderBrush="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}">
                                                <Grid ColumnSpacing="16">
                                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="110"/>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="POWER" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1"
                                                               Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.PowerText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldValueStyle}"/>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </Border>
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <Grid ColumnSpacing="16" Padding="0,8,0,10">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="110"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <TextBlock Text="NWS MESSAGE" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,0,0"
                                                       Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Spacing="6">
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.NoMessageText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                           Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldValueStyle}"
                                                           Visibility="{x:Bind CollapsedWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.HasMessage), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                                <StackPanel Spacing="6"
                                                            Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.HasMessage), Mode=OneWay}">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.Latest.Header, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                               FontSize="12"
                                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                    <Border CornerRadius="6" Padding="10,8"
                                                            Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.NwsDetail.Latest.Text, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                                   FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="12" LineHeight="18"
                                                                   TextWrapping="Wrap" IsTextSelectionEnabled="True"/>
                                                    </Border>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- DATA UPTIME — RadarSiteHistoryViewModel over IRadarUptimeService: 30 local days reconstructed
                                 from gaps in the public archive. ⚠️ INFORMATION, NOT AVAILABILITY (never moves the pill).
                                 ⚠️ Fetches only while the Atlas is OPEN (History.IsActive). Four tiles, the 30-cell strip
                                 (EqualCellsPanel; a dot = an NWS message that day; grey = a day the archive couldn't be
                                 listed — unknown, not down), then the newest six holes (red down / amber gap) with the
                                 message that explains each as the icon's tooltip. A site with NO archive data at all
                                 (KCRI) swaps everything for ONE line rather than "0%". Every word comes from the VM. -->
                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="4" Spacing="8" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                    <TextBlock Text="DATA UPTIME" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="from gaps in the public archive" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                    <ctl:GlossaryHint VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                      Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.UptimeHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    <ProgressRing Width="14" Height="14" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                  IsActive="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.IsLoadingUptime, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                  Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.IsLoadingUptime), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                </StackPanel>

                                <Border CornerRadius="8" Padding="14,12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                        Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhenText(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.UptimeEmptyText), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.UptimeEmptyText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="13" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                </Border>

                                <StackPanel Spacing="12"
                                            Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.HasUptime), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Border Grid.Column="0" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                                Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                            <StackPanel>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.Uptime7Value, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                           FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="LAST 7 DAYS" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>
                                        <Border Grid.Column="1" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                                Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                            <StackPanel>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.Uptime30Value, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                           FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="LAST 30 DAYS" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>
                                        <Border Grid.Column="2" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                                Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                            <StackPanel>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.OutagesValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                           FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.OutagesLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                           Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <!-- The strip: one cell per local day, oldest left. -->
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="4">
                                        <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.DayCells, Mode=OneWay}">
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                                <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                                    <layout:EqualCellsPanel/>
                                                </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:UptimeDayCell">
                                                    <Grid Height="24" Margin="1,0" Background="Transparent"
                                                          ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind ToolTip}">
                                                        <Border CornerRadius="2" Margin="0,6,0,0"
                                                                Background="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.UptimeCellBrush(Level)}"/>
                                                        <Ellipse Width="4" Height="4" VerticalAlignment="Top" HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                                                 Fill="{ThemeResource TextFillColorPrimaryBrush}"
                                                                 Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ShowIf(HasMessage)}"/>
                                                    </Grid>
                                                </DataTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl>
                                        <Grid>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.StripStartLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="11" Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="each cell is one day · dot = NWS message" HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                                       FontSize="11" Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.StripEndLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                                       FontSize="11" Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>

                                    <!-- Holes, newest first. E8BD Message — ⚠️ unverified codepoint, check on first run. -->
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.NoHolesText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="13" Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                               Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhenText(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.NoHolesText), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                    <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.HoleRows, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                  Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.HasHoles), Mode=OneWay}">
                                        <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                            <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:UptimeHoleRow">
                                                <Border BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="0,7"
                                                        BorderBrush="{ThemeResource CardStrokeColorDefaultSolidBrush}">
                                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12">
                                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140"/>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind When}" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="12"
                                                                   VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                   Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                                            <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                     Fill="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.HoleBrush(Kind)}"/>
                                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind What}" FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                                        </StackPanel>
                                                        <FontIcon Grid.Column="2" Glyph="&#xE8BD;" FontSize="13"
                                                                  Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"
                                                                  ToolTipService.ToolTip="{x:Bind MessageHint}"
                                                                  Visibility="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ShowIf(HasMessage)}"/>
                                                    </Grid>
                                                </Border>
                                            </DataTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.MoreHolesText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="12" Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"
                                               Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhenText(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.MoreHolesText), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- MESSAGE HISTORY — every NWS outage message about this site in 30 days (IEM archive), newest
                                 first, verbatim in the NWS STATUS card's mono style. Four show; the rest fold under a
                                 link. A message FILED under another site but naming this one says so in its header
                                 ("filed under TOKC"). NWS STATUS above keeps only the newest (the live 24-h feed). -->
                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="5" Spacing="8" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                    <TextBlock Text="MESSAGE HISTORY" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="NWS outage messages · 30 days" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <Border CornerRadius="8" Padding="14,12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                        Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhenText(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.MessagesEmptyText), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.MessagesEmptyText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="13" Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                </Border>
                                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.MessageRows, Mode=OneWay}"
                                              Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.HasMessages), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:RadarNwsMessageRow">
                                            <StackPanel Spacing="6" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Header}" FontSize="12"
                                                           Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                <Border CornerRadius="6" Padding="10,8"
                                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Text}"
                                                               FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="12" LineHeight="18"
                                                               TextWrapping="Wrap" IsTextSelectionEnabled="True"/>
                                                </Border>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>
                                <!-- E70D ChevronDown / E70E ChevronUp. -->
                                <HyperlinkButton Padding="0,2" Click="OnHistoryMessagesMoreClick"
                                                 Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.HasMoreMessages), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                        <FontIcon FontSize="10"
                                                  Glyph="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ExpandGlyph(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.IsMessagesExpanded), Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.MoreMessagesLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                   FontSize="12"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </HyperlinkButton>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- SCAN PATTERNS — the site's VCP mix from an HOURLY sample (IRadarScanPatternService, ~8 KB
                                 range reads; ~30 s the first time, cached after). ⚠️ Share of sampled HOURS — the caption
                                 says "share of time", never "of volumes". The bar is a star-column Grid rebuilt in
                                 code-behind (RebuildScanBar); it fills day by day while "sampling… n of 30 days" shows.
                                 NON-STANDARD VCPS (NonStandardVcpLog) sits inside, and only appears when this site has
                                 run a pattern VcpCatalog doesn't list. -->
                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="6" Spacing="8" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                    <TextBlock Text="SCAN PATTERNS" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.ScanCaption, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                                <Border CornerRadius="8" Padding="14,12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                        Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhenText(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.ScanEmptyText), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.ScanEmptyText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="13" Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                </Border>
                                <StackPanel Spacing="8"
                                            Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.HasScanShares), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <Border CornerRadius="4" Height="20">
                                        <Grid x:Name="ScanBar" ColumnSpacing="2"/>
                                    </Border>
                                    <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.ScanShares, Mode=OneWay}">
                                        <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                            <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                                <layout:WrapPanel/>
                                            </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                        <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                            <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:ScanShareRow">
                                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6" Margin="0,0,16,4">
                                                    <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                             Fill="{x:Bind win:RadarAtlasWindow.ShareBrush(Index)}"/>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Label}" FontSize="12"
                                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                            </DataTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl>
                                </StackPanel>

                                <Border CornerRadius="8" Padding="14,10"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                        Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.HasNonStandard), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="6">
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                            <TextBlock Text="NON-STANDARD VCPS" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="not in Anvil's list · shown as the radar reported" FontSize="12"
                                                       Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.History.NonStandardRows, Mode=OneWay}">
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                <DataTemplate x:DataType="vm:NonStandardVcpRow">
                                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="12" Padding="0,4">
                                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind Vcp}" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{x:Bind Detail}" FontSize="13"
                                                                   Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{x:Bind When}" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="12"
                                                                   Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                                    </Grid>
                                                </DataTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <StackPanel Grid.Row="7" Spacing="8" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                    <TextBlock Text="YOUR USE" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.UsageSinceText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorTertiaryBrush}"/>
                                    <!-- E75C EraseTool — ⚠️ unverified codepoint, check on first run. -->
                                    <Button Padding="6,2" MinWidth="0" MinHeight="0"
                                            Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0"
                                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Click="OnClearUsageClick"
                                            ToolTipService.ToolTip="Clear your usage history"
                                            Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.CanClearUsage), Mode=OneWay}">
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="4">
                                            <FontIcon FontSize="12" Glyph="&#xE75C;"
                                                      Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="Clear" FontSize="12"
                                                       Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Button>
                                </StackPanel>

                                <!-- Never used: the one line. -->
                                <Border CornerRadius="8" Padding="14,12"
                                        Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}"
                                        Visibility="{x:Bind CollapsedWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.HasUsage), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.UsageEmptyText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                               FontSize="13"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextFillColorSecondaryBrush}"/>
                                </Border>

                                <Grid ColumnSpacing="12"
                                      Visibility="{x:Bind VisibleWhen(ViewModel.RadarAtlas.HasUsage), Mode=OneWay}">
                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                                    <Border Grid.Column="0" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                            Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.UsageLoadsValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.UsageLoadsLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>

                                    <Border Grid.Column="1" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                            Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                        <Grid>
                                            <StackPanel>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.LoadTimeValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                           FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.LoadTimeLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                           TextWrapping="Wrap" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <ctl:GlossaryHint HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                              Card="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.LoadTimeHint, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </Border>

                                    <Border Grid.Column="2" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                            Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.LastUsedValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="LAST USED" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>

                                    <Border Grid.Column="3" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12"
                                            Background="{ThemeResource SubtleFillColorSecondaryBrush}">
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.RankValue, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Bind ViewModel.RadarAtlas.RankLabel, Mode=OneWay}"
                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap" Style="{StaticResource AtlasFieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>
                                </Grid>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>
                        </ScrollViewer>
                    </Grid>
                </Grid>
            </Grid>

        <!-- Lock (no move/resize) + pin (keep on top). -->
        <ctl:LockToggle IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.IsRadarAtlasLocked, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
        <ctl:PinToggle IsChecked="{x:Bind ViewModel.IsRadarAtlasOnTop, Mode=TwoWay}"/>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
